~ start
if not Global.has_met_james
	John: Hi, Im john, an aspiring merchant 
	John: but as you can see I dont have anything I can sell to you yet

else
	if not Global.has_met_mary
		John: So, james needed some wood 
		John: unfortunately, some rocks blocked the path
		John: But we're at it, we are almost finished clearing the rock
		John: just look for an axe so you can get some woods
		John: my daughter mary should have an axe
		John: she is at the bay checking if the water rises again 
		John: you should see her 
		set Global.has_met_john = true
	if Global.has_met_mary
		John: you are right on time 
		John: we are done clearing the road
		John: you can now get woods
		John: be careful out there young man
		set Global.done_meeting_john = true
=> END